  "id": "grounds-a-blackcast",
  "title": "Grounds: A Blackcast",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "GROUNDS is the story of 5 Black Professors at a 4 year PWI. A fictitious small college and town in the rural south, which is the home of a predominately white 4 year college. The story follows the lives of five Black professors. The only full time, tenure track Black lecturers who work at Morris & Wilkins University. Season Two progresses the story through the first year of teaching during a global pandemic. It highlights the trials, obstacles, and joys of maintaining a Black existence within a white academic structure. Season Two Premieres September 17, 2021",
